&=-\frac{9}{2}-\frac{2}{3}+\frac{2}{27}\\
&=-\frac{275}{54}
\end{aligned}
$$

The normal is perpendicular to the tangent, so take the negative reciprocal:

$$
\begin{aligned}
m'&=-\frac{1}{m}\\
&=-\frac{1}{\left(-\frac{275}{54}\right)}\\
&=\frac{54}{275}
\end{aligned}
$$

